      "needsText": [
        "Before Grafana Alloy can collect HAProxy metrics, you need to enable the HAProxy stats endpoint. This endpoint exposes real-time metrics about frontends, backends, and individual servers in a format that Alloy can scrape.\n\nThis step happens on your HAProxy server, not in the Grafana Cloud UI.",
        "The built-in Prometheus exporter requires HAProxy 2.0 or later. If you are running an older version, you need to use an external exporter."
